---
# 见 https://ansible.readthedocs.io/projects/lint/configuring/
profile: basic
# 现有角色的历史写法(短模块名、变量不加 role 前缀等)不在本次整合范围内统一整改,
# 先保证"能跑 + 结构正确", 后续再逐步开启 production profile。
skip_list:
    - fqcn
    - no-free-form
    - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
    - yaml[line-length]
    - name[casing]
    - risky-file-permissions
    - command-instead-of-module
    - no-changed-when
